---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | bensparrowdev"
  description="This privacy policy sets out how Ben Sparrow (trading as bensparrowdev) uses and protects any information that you give us."
  bgText="info safe"
>
  <section class="container-lg mx-auto mb-12 privacy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy.</h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to bensparrowdev, my portfolio website dedicated to showcasing my
      web development expertise. This privacy policy aims to inform you about
      how I, as the website owner, collect, use, and protect your personal data
      in compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and other
      relevant data protection laws.
    </p>
    <div>
      <h3>Personal Information Collection</h3>
      <ul class="text-body dark:text-body_dark mb-4">
        <span
          >I collect personal information through the following methods:</span
        >
        <li>
          <strong>Contact Form:</strong> When you use the contact form on my website,
          you provide me with your full name, email address, and any message you
          wish to send. This information is used solely to respond to your enquiries
          or to communicate with you.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Analytics:</strong> To improve your experience on my website,
          I use Google Analytics to collect general data about user behavior. This
          helps me understand how visitors interact with my website, allowing me
          to enhance its functionality and content.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Use of Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        My website uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. Upon your
        first visit, a cookies banner is presented, giving you the choice to
        accept or decline the collection of cookies. These cookies are used to
        collect analytical data through Google Analytics and to remember your
        preferences on the site. They will expire every 30 days, or if rejected,
        it will ask again in 7 days.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Data Protection</h3>
      <p>
        I take your privacy seriously and implement various security measures to
        protect your personal information. Your data is not shared with any
        third parties, ensuring that your personal details remain confidential.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Spam Protection</h3>
      <p>
        To prevent spam through the contact form, I utilise reCAPTCHA, a service
        provided by Google. reCAPTCHA analyzes your actions to differentiate
        between genuine users and automated software, enhancing the security of
        my website and protecting it from spam and abuse.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Your Rights Under GDPR</h3>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict,
        or object to the processing of your personal data. If you wish to
        exercise any of these rights or have concerns about your privacy on my
        website, please contact me at <a href="mailto:hello@bensparrow.dev"
          >hello@bensparrow.dev</a
        > or through the contact form.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Contact Information</h3>
      <p>
        For any questions or concerns regarding this privacy policy or your
        personal data, please reach out to me via email at <a
          href="mailto:hello@bensparrow.dev">hello@bensparrow.dev</a
        >
        or use the contact form available on my website.
      </p>
      <p>
        This privacy policy is subject to updates and changes. I encourage you
        to review it periodically.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy div {
    @apply mb-4;
  }
  .privacy h3 {
    @apply mb-2;
  }
  .privacy ul {
    @apply text-lg font-normal leading-8;
  }
  .privacy ul li {
    @apply list-inside list-disc;
  }
</style>
